<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-25T08:56:13.968Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels have pulled back from near Bunia after heavy clashes, while fighting intensifies elsewhere as they open a new front near the Uganda border and target Uvira city. WHO evacuated its Ebola response team from a hospital in Ituri after the team was trapped by fighting, and the Ebola death rate is now near 50%. A Congolese military aircraft went missing, with rebels claiming they shot it down, leading to the capture of a South African mercenary and the reported capture of Ugandan and South African nationals. Kenya and the DRC have agreed to restore diplomatic ties after recent tensions. The conflict has displaced 8.2 million people, according to DNE Africa.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQWDdrcllEUWhscEtTb1k0WGVQOGhsZGJGbjY5VS1IM004VUNlVnpheFlFNGFfU0pFZlg5TjRNRi1ib3IyVzNrRDBoczk2cWhtaTZvTXJ5LTVqZldLVGFfaWVGRWY1VXM5b0tjQUp2VnRUNTQ0T0lPa05EUTNGZC1kRXIyWDdRTC0tOVNXa2c5aDQzamE5ZHp2OFY5RDQwUnRtT01PUWlicWNFNEw2SENBc0NKb09VeC1Y0gG-AUFVX3lxTE5peTRoS1NQY2hRWktSV19HczN1WmRQaXZ4UEVUN21ZNHQ3ZkFfbUdJYW14dC10YWVqQ3dyTHMzODJsRnkweG1RbWZNMXg4ejd6T2NFeXJGaWlwSWdsS0hPYjB2LTVlVmtIWTY4MFlOdHEtMjFYV1gxeVRCOXY1TWJzbHhHV1VzcG9tS1dvVHNNTExJcmpvbEZpQWZmQzZCSEpLSkNoRlktT3h2MEEyU0VUSHR6cDNVb3BlMjRpT3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE5QVDc3MUtCdWYxdVdmUnhmeTlyRmVyaERfOVJWZllSbVZYQzEydEdaYWRaNjdpb05WRzdNSTZ2UmFxMDZONm1wRUEwN2pNdnhCT19LRDQzdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Welcome to the United Nations&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFAzNFFDc3pSbTNrVmFYdWcyUGxROWpkeEVkbUh6SVJvN3NFMmFHRjlpbW1rTnZHNzBySUFZRUllX2pXSWU5U0xLb0tueXBuUzgtV01KOHpBWU9OMlh1MWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPNTh6UEhmRFNqcUsxeUJFZDkxR2tkRVlDY3Q3akhsMHgzeXR